        "promptSimple":  "Use the provided image as the first frame. A powerful gale-force wind slams into the subject: their hair whips out sideways, clothing ripples and flaps hard, and leaves and small debris streak past through the air, while the subject squints, grits their teeth, and holds their ground. Static camera, cinematic outdoor light.",
