        "summaryHe":  "אפקט לתמונת סטילס שמנקה רעש וגרעיניות מהתמונה: התמונה עוברת ממראה מחוספס ומלוכלך לחדות נקייה וצלולה, בלי לאבד את הפרטים, הצבעים או האווירה המקורית של הצילום.",
        "promptSimple":  "Use my image and remove all noise and grain: clean up the rough, speckled texture across the whole frame and make the image sharp and clear. Keep the exact same composition, subject, colors, lighting, and mood — just a clean, crisp version of the same photo.",
        "promptExtended":  "Use the provided image and preserve the original composition, character identity, clothing, lighting direction, color palette, lens perspective, and environment layout. This is a still-image transformation producing a single cleaned photograph.\nRemove the heavy noise and film grain covering the frame: the speckled, gritty texture dissolves into smooth, clean tonality across skin, sky, shadows, and flat surfaces, while genuine fine detail — hair strands, fabric weave, fur, surface texture, distant background elements — is retained and rendered crisply. Dark areas become deep and clean instead of muddy and speckled, highlights stay smooth without banding, and edges gain clarity without artificial over-sharpening halos. The photograph\u0027s original exposure, contrast, color grade, and atmosphere remain exactly the same; the result is simply the same image as if captured with a clean, low-light-capable modern sensor. No changes to the subject, no face morphing, no background redesign, no added or removed objects, no color shifts."
