        "promptSimple":  "Use my video and keep the subject exactly the same — identity, clothing, pose, and motion. Replace the entire background with a new location of my choice, matching the perspective and lighting so the subject looks naturally placed in the new environment.",
        "promptExtended":  "Use the provided video as the source and preserve the original character identity, clothing, framing, lens perspective, and the subject\u0027s natural motion.\nThe entire environment behind and around the subject is replaced with a new location, fully believable and alive: the new background has its own depth, moving elements, and ambient activity, rendered with correct perspective relative to the camera. The lighting on the subject adapts subtly to match the new setting — color temperature, brightness, and soft reflections — so they appear genuinely photographed there rather than pasted in. Edge detail around hair and clothing stays clean and natural against the new backdrop. The subject continues behaving naturally in the space, and the shot can transition smoothly between two or three different locations in sequence, the subject remaining perfectly consistent through each change. No face morphing, no outfit changes, no identity drift, no extra limbs, no sudden cuts."
